<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mostostal Export started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mostostal Export started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Thursday analyst Gene Linetsky had started coverage of Polish construction and trading company Mostostal Export SA with a rating of sell.</p>
<p>-- In a March 3 report, Linetsky said the stock would continue to underperform the Polish market.</p>
<p>-- He set a 12-month price target of nine zlotys a share, representing a nominal zloty return of 12.5 percent and a dollar return of four percent.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
